==== hyperbricks yaml {!{fragment}} ====
fragment:
  - type: fragment
  - response:
      hx_reswap: innerHTML
==== explainer ====
Allows you to specify how the response will be swapped. See hx-swap in the [HTMX documentation](https://htmx.org/).
==== expected json ====
{
  "Cache": "",
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<FRAGMENT>",
  "ContentType": "",
